The '''Ravenous Rhino''' is an [[NPC]] that only appears in {{zone|The Garden}}. They require 50 unique [[The Garden#Visitors|Visitors]] to unlock and only appear while {{NPCSprite|Finnegan}}'s Blooming Business Perk is active. Completing their offer requires {{Item|Enchanted Cake|amount=32}} or {{Item|Enchanted Bread|amount=2048}} chosen at random. Accepting the offer awards the player with an {{Item|Enchanted Book|enchant=Dedication IV}}.

